R Rg g1 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 s1 VSS
L Ls s1 VSS
L L2 VDD n2
C C2 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n3
NMOS NM3 n3 n3 VSS VSS
R R2 n3 s1
C Cbyp n1 VSS